<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Airgas downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Airgas downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said analyst Donald Carson downgraded Airgas Inc to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited company announcement Monday that its earnings for the fourth quarter ended March 31, excluding charges, will be below analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>-- Cut fourth quarter estimate to $0.16 from $0.20. Dropped fiscal year 1998 estimate to $0.76 from $0.90.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 14-5/8.</p>
</text>
